--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Models and runtimes
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

No model weights or runtime binaries are stored in this repository. The scripts
under `scripts/` download them on demand and verify their sha256 checksums:

  * ONNX Runtime -- https://github.com/microsoft/onnxruntime
  * llama.cpp runtime packages -- https://github.com/ggml-org/llama.cpp
  * EmbeddingGemma 2 (ONNX and GGUF) -- https://ai.google.dev/gemma
  * PP-OCRv5 (ONNX) -- https://github.com/PaddlePaddle/PaddleOCR

